==Battleground==
*1 [[The Face]] spawns.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>, delay 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Bun Bun]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*2 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*3 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 2~2.67 seconds<sup>60f~80f</sup>.
*4 [[Li'l Bun Bun]]s spawn after 136.67 seconds<sup>4,100f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam [[Cameraman Cat]] and any other Area Attackers you brought in your lineup.

